  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "0d851fd8-519f-45b3-9ffc-0c03e44bceef",
    "name": "Talkpush Agents API Folders API API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "<b>Production Base URL to be used during implementation:</b> {your company workspace subdomain}.talkpush.com/api/talkpush_services\n\nWith the Talkpush APIs you can instantly plug your lead source into out platform to enjoy the benefits of Talkpush. You can also synch your <b> existing HR / Recruitment technology stack </b> with your Talkpush account. To be able to use our API you will need pass an api key as a parameter for each API call.  In case you do not know your current API key you can contact our support team at cs@talkpush.com.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Email: admin@talkpush.com",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
